Module elsewhere "Ianthe walks to the Guild" {
  // Quittance's sd 1 and 8 (QTC-A31): Ianthe is declared in a file another author keeps, without `Uses go`; her
  // errand, written here, says what she goes by and how far ahead she plans, six ways off.
  Place town "the town" is settlement.
  Place study "the study" is room within town at 0, 0.
  Place hall "the hall" is room within town at 1, 0.
  Place steps "the steps" is room within town at 2, 0 outdoors.
  Place street "the street" is room within town at 3, 0 outdoors.
  Place square "the square" is room within town at 4, 0 outdoors.
  Place porch "the Guild porch" is room within town at 5, 0 outdoors.
  Place guild "the Guild hall" is room within town at 6, 0.
  Passage w1 "the study door" is door between study and hall.
  Passage w2 "the front door" is door between hall and steps.
  Passage w3 "the steps down" is path between steps and street.
  Passage w4 "the street" is path between street and square.
  Passage w5 "the far side of the square" is path between square and porch.
  Passage w6 "the Guild door" is door between porch and guild.
  Company party "You" of 1 at square.
  Person ianthe "Ianthe" at study { Role "a surveyor's daughter". Peaceable. Pronouns she. }
  Pursuit to_guild for ianthe "going to the Guild" priority 5 when watch(clock) >= 1 seeks at(ianthe, guild) using go planning 14 steps.
  Observe square_scene at square when true "A square.".
  Goal false.
}
